# Betaflight CLI snippet
#
# DEAD END (verified 2026-07): this does NOT cut the 9V rail on the FLYWOOF405S_AIO.
# The board has no PINIO / no VTX power-enable pin -- PC8 is just MOTOR8, and nothing
# gates the 9V rail. The PC8=PINIO2 idea came from a different board (F405HD-AIOv2).
# Kept only as a record of what was tried. See firefly16.md for the full write-up and
# the recovery approach (motor DShot beacon + self-powered finder buzzer).
#
# FLYWOOF405S_AIO: free PC8 from Motor 8 so PINIO 2 can drive the 9V rail enable.
# Matches EdgeTX USER2 on AUX5 (pinio_box USER1=40, USER2=41).
# Recorded on the vehicle in config/BTFL_cli_FIREFLY-WH16_FLYWOOF405S_AIO.txt (# resources).

batch start

resource MOTOR 8 NONE
resource PINIO 2 C08
set pinio_box = 40,41,255,255

batch end

save
